stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> CheckpointCheck: Invocation with (repo, statement)

    state CheckpointCheck {
        direction TB
        InspectRunState: Read .devkit/run-state/stage-log.md
        HashValidation: Compute SHA-256 of feature statement
        InspectRunState --> HashValidation
    }

    CheckpointCheck --> NewRun: stage-log.md absent
    CheckpointCheck --> HashMismatch: stage-log.md exists BUT hash mismatch
    CheckpointCheck --> ValidResumption: stage-log.md exists AND hash matches

    state HashMismatch {
        PurgeOld: Purge stale .devkit/run-state/*
        LogWarning: Log state mismatch warning
        PurgeOld --> LogWarning
    }
    HashMismatch --> NewRun

    state NewRun {
        Stage1: Stage 1 Intake -> write intake.md & stage-log.md
    }

    state ValidResumption {
        DetectStage: Find last stage with status COMPLETED
        FastForward: Skip completed stages without re-running
        DetectStage --> FastForward
    }

    NewRun --> PipelineExecution
    ValidResumption --> PipelineExecution: Resume at first non-completed stage

    state PipelineExecution {
        Stage2: Stage 2 Recon -> write repo-map.md, repo-type.md
        Stage3: Stage 3 Arch -> write architecture.md, conventions.md
        Stage4To7: Stages 4-7 Planning -> write Blueprints in .devkit/plans/<slug>/
        Stage8: Stage 8 Gates -> evaluate QG-H1..H5 & QG-S1..S4
        
        Stage2 --> Stage3
        Stage3 --> Stage4To7
        Stage4To7 --> Stage8
    }

    PipelineExecution --> Interruption: Session terminates / Quota cut / Timeout
    Interruption --> [*]: Checkpoints safely preserved on disk

    PipelineExecution --> RunSuccess: Stage 8 Completes
    
    state RunSuccess {
        PromoteLog: Promote stage-log.md to .devkit/plans/<slug>/plan-run.log
        CleanRunState: Purge temporary files in .devkit/run-state/
        PromoteLog --> CleanRunState
    }

    RunSuccess --> [*]: Complete Blueprint Ready for Execution
